<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LVClass LVVersion="13008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.DefaultMenu" Type="Str">BaseDriver.mnu</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Base class for the instrument communication driver. The driver sends messages to a  remote destination (using an instance of the Reader class) and emits any incoming response to the calling application with a Responder object.

The driver handles timeouts and resends of transmissions.

To use, configure a Reader and a Responder, add them to the driver and call the drivers Run method</Property>
